## SQS Architecture

### Configuration

- `maxReceiveCount: 3` (3 retries -> DLQ)
- `visibilityTimeout: 900` (15 minutes)
- `messageRetentionPeriod: 1209600` (14 days)

### SQS Poller (DEV ONLY)

**Location**: `tools/sqs-poller/`
**Purpose**: Poll SQS queues and invoke Lambda workers in LocalStack
**Why**: LocalStack doesn't reliably support native Lambda-SQS event source mappings

**Development**: Custom Node.js poller runs in Docker container
**Production**: Uses native AWS Lambda-SQS event source mappings (no custom poller needed)

